<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italian BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italian BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a 15th tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying an 8.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   July 1, 2006	previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.99 pct  vs    7.30 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     8.10 pct  vs    8.42 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  105.30    vs    103.20</p>
<p> Bids		 3.592 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   1.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The comparisons are with a previous auction on Sept 27 of a 13th tranche of 10-year BTPs.</p>
</text>
